  "provenance": "Hosted GitHub Actions measurements, in two families. Contract family: maximum observed job wall seconds per deep contract module from successful functional runs (sources: the 27-module contract matrices of runs 40626989297/40621712822/40618167136 and the advisory dispatch timings recorded from functional run 40019154805). Routine family: sum of collected test durations per module from the functional-infra JUnit artifacts of run 40718577012 at commit f7321d2c (shards 0-2, 456 cases, 264.3 test-seconds); it excludes per-job process setup, so compare modules within a family, never across families. The two families are never balanced into one shard: contract modules run in dedicated single-module jobs, routine modules are the only inputs to the functional shard plan. Unmeasured roster modules fall back to byte size until a measurement is added here. Local developer machines are faster than the hosted runners, so these values describe hosted CI, not local wall time. Modules whose hosted JUnit total rounds below 0.05 s carry no usable weight and are omitted, so they keep the byte-size fallback.",
  "schema_version": "template-ci-module-durations-v1",
